    {
      "text": "change things? \n\n“We’ve already imposed sanctions on more than 100 Chinese entities, export controls and we’re fully prepared to take additional measures,” Blinken said.” https://t.co/aMKxEreTDq",
      "date": "2024-04-26",
      "date_quote": "2024-04-26T18:20:00.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Elbridge A. Colby. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
