      "text": "Washington as hostile acts, including export controls on advanced semiconductor technology and new military agreements with other Asian nations.\" \n\nYep. If anything, this diplomacy might",
      "date": "2023-07-11",
      "date_quote": "2023-07-11T12:21:35.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Elbridge A. Colby. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
