    {
      "text": "should recognize that sanctions and export controls are not going to affect Putin’s strategic calculus, which will be shaped much more heavily by events on",
      "date": "2023-04-06",
      "date_quote": "2023-04-06T14:23:46.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Elbridge A. Colby. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
