    },
    {
      "text": "sanctions. Key takeaways: \n\n\"Sanctions and export controls have been useful in undermining Russia’s financial resources and industrial base, but they have done little to change",
      "date": "2023-04-06",
      "date_quote": "2023-04-06T14:16:19.000Z",
      "context": "Verified direct statement by Elbridge A. Colby. Local verification records retain the source attribution.",
